# Google Calendar Integration (OAuth 2.0 Web Client ID)
# 1. Go to Google Cloud Console (console.cloud.google.com) -> APIs & Services -> Credentials
# 2. Create OAuth 2.0 Client ID -> Web Application
# 3. Add Authorized JavaScript origin: http://localhost:5173
# 4. Copy the Client ID here:
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
